g=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+1 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +1 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Dragon Bane 2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Dragon Bane 2</a>:</b> This weapon is attuned specifically to disrupt those with draconic blood, dealing an additional 2d10 bane damage vs. Dragons.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Tidal\" title=\"Tidal\">Tidal</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Tidal\" title=\"Tidal\">Tidal</a>:</b> This weapon is sheathed in water. A tidal weapon deals an extra 1 to 4 points of damage on a successful hit. Creatures with the <a href=\"/page/Fire_trait\" title=\"Fire trait\">Fire trait</a> take double this damage instead.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Calomel_Scimitar_(level_4).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Calomel_Scimitar_%28level_4%29.png/420px-Calomel_Scimitar_%28level_4%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"460\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Calomel_Scimitar_%28level_4%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Vaults_of_the_Artificers\" title=\"Vaults of the Artificers\">Vaults of the Artificers</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>A weapon crafted from durable white Calomel ore is always sheathed in condensed water droplets. It is particularly effective against dragons and fiery creatures.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><b>See also:</b> <a href=\"/page/Item:Calomel_Scimitar\" title=\"Item:Calomel Scimitar\">Calomel Scimitar</a> - Full table of the  Calomel Scimitar\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817201834\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.131 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3424/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24909/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6825/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransc